(7110500, 1084854, 37999, '<td valign="top">So cute. You have some good lighting set up and an interesting pose. Nothing bad to say at all. Black cats are some of the hardest to capture! <b>10</b></td>', 'So cute. You have some good lighting set up and an interesting pose. Nothing bad to say at all. Black cats are some of the hardest to capture! 10', '2013-10-03 14:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7110502, 1084466, 37999, '<td valign="top">I like the focus on the eye but there is just something off or missing for me. I can''t put my finger on it though. Maybe I need a big more in focus. To much DOF going on here? But I do like the composition and the black on black with the light on the cat so I am going to still give you a higher score.</td>', 'I like the focus on the eye but there is just something off or missing for me. I can''t put my finger on it though. Maybe I need a big more in focus. To much DOF going on here? But I do like the composition and the black on black with the light on the cat so I am going to still give you a higher score.', '2013-10-03 14:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
