(7110506, 1084174, 37999, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo and I like that you chose to go non color. It adds that feeling behind it. That is what makes a great photograph. Moving someone when they look at it. They don''t want to look away. Awesome job! <b>10 </b> my friend</td>', 'I really like this photo and I like that you chose to go non color. It adds that feeling behind it. That is what makes a great photograph. Moving someone when they look at it. They don''t want to look away. Awesome job! 10  my friend', '2013-10-03 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7110509, 1084336, 37999, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo. I think the DOF is a bit off. The sand and leafs in the foreground are in focus which throws me off a bit. If you can play around with your camera and DOF your could get the cat in focus, foreground out and still achieve a good looking photo. Not sure on your set up though...</td>', 'This is a cute photo. I think the DOF is a bit off. The sand and leafs in the foreground are in focus which throws me off a bit. If you can play around with your camera and DOF your could get the cat in focus, foreground out and still achieve a good looking photo. Not sure on your set up though...', '2013-10-03 14:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7110511, 1084872, 37999, '<td valign="top">This is a great try. Unfortunately we have a focus issue here and it looks like you may have tried to fix that in an editing program with a sharpen tool. The eyes are flat without focus and the nose is as well. Keep trying though!</td>', 'This is a great try. Unfortunately we have a focus issue here and it looks like you may have tried to fix that in an editing program with a sharpen tool. The eyes are flat without focus and the nose is as well. Keep trying though!', '2013-10-03 14:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
