(7111996, 1084417, 37999, '<td valign="top">ummm... Not sure where to start. I can see the outline of a cat. There seems to be a haze. Not sure if you just entered this for fun or what....  =^..^=   &lt;-----  CAT</td>', 'ummm... Not sure where to start. I can see the outline of a cat. There seems to be a haze. Not sure if you just entered this for fun or what....  =^..^=   <-----  CAT', '2013-10-06 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7111997, 1084886, 37999, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful cat and photo! So mesmerizing with her/his pattern. I''ve seen Bengal cats with patterns similar but never one this color!   =^..^=   &lt;-----  CAT</td>', 'Very beautiful cat and photo! So mesmerizing with her/his pattern. I''ve seen Bengal cats with patterns similar but never one this color!   =^..^=   <-----  CAT', '2013-10-06 23:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112001, 1084187, 37999, '<td valign="top">Nice looking cat. Very good framing, Overall look is good and you managed to get the lighting right on his face and the DOF is great. For me it does not have a <b>POP</b> but overall I do really like this photo!   =^..^=   &lt;---  CAT</td>', 'Nice looking cat. Very good framing, Overall look is good and you managed to get the lighting right on his face and the DOF is great. For me it does not have a POP but overall I do really like this photo!   =^..^=   <---  CAT', '2013-10-06 23:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112004, 1084846, 37999, '<td valign="top">It''s a one tone photo. Needs more contrast, color, or maybe just a color faded look.</td>', 'It''s a one tone photo. Needs more contrast, color, or maybe just a color faded look.', '2013-10-06 23:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112005, 1084845, 37999, '<td valign="top">seems a bit under exposed. Very good looking buy. His face is in focse and he has a glint in his eye. I would have voted this higher if the photo was lighter.</td>', 'seems a bit under exposed. Very good looking buy. His face is in focse and he has a glint in his eye. I would have voted this higher if the photo was lighter.', '2013-10-06 23:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112008, 1084782, 37999, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is going in the right direction. I''m not sure but it looks like she either has eye issues or you may have smudged the glint away from her eyes? I hope she''s okay. I''m not a fan of the crop job here and maybe the background being lighter may have helped a bit. Other than that You have a NICE crisp focus on her face and nose which is excellent!!!    =^..^=   &lt;-----  CAT</td>', 'I think this photo is going in the right direction. I''m not sure but it looks like she either has eye issues or you may have smudged the glint away from her eyes? I hope she''s okay. I''m not a fan of the crop job here and maybe the background being lighter may have helped a bit. Other than that You have a NICE crisp focus on her face and nose which is excellent!!!    =^..^=   <-----  CAT', '2013-10-06 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112010, 1084841, 37999, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful Tortie! It looks as though her lower face (mid-nose) down is either slightly out of focus or there is a haze of some sort. Can''t figure that out. But the cropping is wonderful and so is the DOF.</td>', 'Such a beautiful Tortie! It looks as though her lower face (mid-nose) down is either slightly out of focus or there is a haze of some sort. Can''t figure that out. But the cropping is wonderful and so is the DOF.', '2013-10-06 23:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112018, 1084871, 37999, '<td valign="top">Left whiskers are in focus but that is about it. I know how difficult it is to get a cat to cooperate with you! If you play around with your DOF. A f/2.8 will give you more out of focus basically. The smaller the F number the more blurred in the background. and the higher like a f/22 will be more in focus all together through the whole photo. At least that''s how I learned. On the other hand, if this was your desired outcome, Good Job!  =^..^=   &lt;--- CAT</td>', 'Left whiskers are in focus but that is about it. I know how difficult it is to get a cat to cooperate with you! If you play around with your DOF. A f/2.8 will give you more out of focus basically. The smaller the F number the more blurred in the background. and the higher like a f/22 will be more in focus all together through the whole photo. At least that''s how I learned. On the other hand, if this was your desired outcome, Good Job!  =^..^=   <--- CAT', '2013-10-06 23:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112020, 1084186, 37999, '<td valign="top">What a cute face she/he has! If there were a different background it would improve the overall photo. But Great Job!  <b>=^..^= </b>  &lt;--- CAT</td>', 'What a cute face she/he has! If there were a different background it would improve the overall photo. But Great Job!  =^..^=   <--- CAT', '2013-10-06 23:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112022, 1084899, 37999, '<td valign="top">Tortie Love! Her face is nice and sharp, and you have a good blurred background which helps the photo! Great Job. I have a soft spot for Torties!!!  <b>=^..^= </b>  &lt;--- CAT</td>', 'Tortie Love! Her face is nice and sharp, and you have a good blurred background which helps the photo! Great Job. I have a soft spot for Torties!!!  =^..^=   <--- CAT', '2013-10-07 00:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112025, 1084784, 37999, '<td valign="top">What a cute kiddo! It either looks like she is a dilute type cat or just light  colored. either way the photo is just way to light. I think this photo may have stood out better with a little darkening or maybe boosting the color in those gorgeous blue eyes!!</td>', 'What a cute kiddo! It either looks like she is a dilute type cat or just light  colored. either way the photo is just way to light. I think this photo may have stood out better with a little darkening or maybe boosting the color in those gorgeous blue eyes!!', '2013-10-07 00:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112027, 1084869, 37999, '<td valign="top">Very cute cat. He/his eyes set off nicely. My only issue here is the white fur meeting and almost white floor. It almost blends together. But so cute. LOVE those eyes!!!</td>', 'Very cute cat. He/his eyes set off nicely. My only issue here is the white fur meeting and almost white floor. It almost blends together. But so cute. LOVE those eyes!!!', '2013-10-07 00:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112031, 1084691, 37999, '<td valign="top">It looks like Bailey is a dilute Tortie? Anyway she is so cute here. I think a little more contrast or maybe a different crop to show some surrounds. But either way she is a cutie and those eyes and orange streak down her nose is so cute!  <b>=^..^= </b>  &lt;--- CAT</td>', 'It looks like Bailey is a dilute Tortie? Anyway she is so cute here. I think a little more contrast or maybe a different crop to show some surrounds. But either way she is a cutie and those eyes and orange streak down her nose is so cute!  =^..^=   <--- CAT', '2013-10-07 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7112033, 1084371, 37999, '<td valign="top">Kitty Under Cover... With the way the light is coming in on the floor and some on your cat it looks so cute. Your focus on the cat is nice. Maybe in the future you can play with some DOF. Making the background and foreground a bit out of focus. It can give added effect. Not say this is not a good photo though!!  <b>=^..^= </b>  &lt;--- CAT</td>', 'Kitty Under Cover... With the way the light is coming in on the floor and some on your cat it looks so cute. Your focus on the cat is nice. Maybe in the future you can play with some DOF. Making the background and foreground a bit out of focus. It can give added effect. Not say this is not a good photo though!!  =^..^=   <--- CAT', '2013-10-07 00:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
