(7113327, 1084853, 170018, '<td valign="top">I feel very honored to be welcomed so warmly in this terrific community!<br/>Very inspirational!<br/>Was afraid that going for "cute" would not really work here. So my first submission was much more somber:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1084973" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1084973.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1084973.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/170018/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1084973.jpg"/></a> <br/>Re-reading the rules though realized that my regular way of converting files in Lightroom and not saving the originals would not work. Too late.<br/>Had to grab the camera again and chase the cat to his full surrender.<br/>Thank you all for your generous voting and nice comments! Truly helpful. ''m afraid though that buzz in my head from all the ideas will not let my family sleep well...<br/>P.S. I know some people find it gross, but the favorite treat for my cat is not the cheezburger, but ...earwax. Sorry. If you haven''t tried it with you cat - do it, you might be surprised. :-)</td>', 'I feel very honored to be welcomed so warmly in this terrific community!Very inspirational!Was afraid that going for "cute" would not really work here. So my first submission was much more somber: Re-reading the rules though realized that my regular way of converting files in Lightroom and not saving the originals would not work. Too late.Had to grab the camera again and chase the cat to his full surrender.Thank you all for your generous voting and nice comments! Truly helpful. ''m afraid though that buzz in my head from all the ideas will not let my family sleep well...P.S. I know some people find it gross, but the favorite treat for my cat is not the cheezburger, but ...earwax. Sorry. If you haven''t tried it with you cat - do it, you might be surprised. :-)', '2013-10-09 02:00:44.000000', NULL, 0),
