(7114596, 1084854, 37999, '<td valign="top">I congratulate you on your first place ribbon. Capturing a black cat by itself is one thing and without a "cat Wrangler" is the hardest thing to do with a cat you did an amazing job and deserve that ribbon. I take photos of cats on the weekends for a nonprofit group and even with a "cat Wrangler" there to pose the cats it is still a little crazy with the cats jumping down or moving around and once they let go there is no telling what will happen! so I applaud you on a great photo you deserve that number one spot!  =^..^=</td>', 'I congratulate you on your first place ribbon. Capturing a black cat by itself is one thing and without a "cat Wrangler" is the hardest thing to do with a cat you did an amazing job and deserve that ribbon. I take photos of cats on the weekends for a nonprofit group and even with a "cat Wrangler" there to pose the cats it is still a little crazy with the cats jumping down or moving around and once they let go there is no telling what will happen! so I applaud you on a great photo you deserve that number one spot!  =^..^=', '2013-10-11 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 0),
